{
  "name": "dimension_over_a_note_is_said",
  "family": "drawing",
  "why": "REPORT 8CD843, ROUND 21, POINT 5 (28/10/2026). On the real drawings of 26P000007 to 26M000002 dimensions went over the label of a detail and over the title block, and «overlapping_texts» said nothing: it compared a text with the other texts and with the lines of its view only. Now it compares it with every note of the sheet and of its views (the label of a detail is a note of its view) and with the title block the format declares, and «overlaps_checked_against» says what was compared.",
  "defect_caught": "A dimension written over a note read as free: the notes not compared, compared with the wrong rectangle (GetExtent read as a point and a size), or the walk over the notes broken off and taken as the notes of the sheet.",
  "_why_two_notes_of_the_size_of_the_sheet": "Where a dimension lands is not known before it is placed, and where a note grows from its text point (up or down) is not written in the guide. Two notes of 70 lines of 130 characters, one with its text point near the top of the A3 and one near the bottom, cover the sheet whichever way they grow: every dimension of V1 falls on one of them.",
  "start": {
    "new_part": true
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "operation": "extrude_rectangle",
      "arguments": {
        "plane": "top",
        "length_mm": 120,
        "width_mm": 80,
        "thickness_mm": 10,
        "centered": true
      },
      "expect": [
        {
          "what": "volume_mm3",
          "equal_to": 96000,
          "why": "the plate of «part_overall_size»"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "operation": "save_document",
      "arguments": {
        "path": "{WORK}\\dimension_over_a_note_is_said.sldprt"
      },
      "expect": [
        {
          "what": "measurements.warnings",
          "equal_to": 0,
          "why": "a drawing is made on a saved part"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "operation": "create_drawing",
      "arguments": {
        "paper_size": "A3"
      },
      "expect": [
        {
          "what": "state.kind",
          "equal_to": "drawing",
          "why": "the drawing is the active document"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
